Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:12:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] chore(dev): add frame statistics

Problem: Needed fps, GPU busy time and compile cost per interval to profile stutter.

Root cause: Diagnostics only; no defect.

Fix: MVKFrameStats.h: every 2 s of presents one line in $WINEPREFIX/drive_c/gfx-frames.log with fps, average/worst interval, GPU busy per frame, command buffers per frame, SPIR-V->MSL / MSL->library / render / compute PSO compile counts and time, and draws waited on deferred PSOs.

Verified by: Used for the hoist and deferred-PSO measurements.

Off switch: off by default; MVK_FRAME_STATS=1 enables
